make test       32 Passed | 0 Failed (913 assertions, ~52 ms)
make sanitize   32 Passed | 0 Failed (ASan + UBSan clean, ~56 ms)
Stress loop     20/20 consecutive clean passes of test_runner (zero leaks, zero stalls)
make run        Smoke probe clean
```

